## TeleHealth Trends Dashboard (Power BI – Healthcare Analytics)

This Power BI dashboard explores telehealth visit patterns using synthetic healthcare data. It focuses on patient demographics, appointment trends, satisfaction scores, and department referrals across various time frames and care types.

### 📊 Dashboard Insights:
- **KPI Overview**: Total visits, gender split, weekday/weekend traffic, average wait time, satisfaction score
- **Time Trends**: Daily, monthly, quarterly, and yearly visit breakdowns with interactive slicers
- **Demographics**: Gender, race, and age distribution analysis
- **Operational Metrics**: Wait time patterns, visit time (AM/PM), department referrals, and admin flag status
- **Satisfaction Analysis**: Score distribution and trend interpretation

